                    "targetname": "s3_relay_shanyi",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Gradually enter her dreams and take a look into her past **>15.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_shanyi",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ＜＜ Warning: Quickly gather the remaining fragments of memories scattered throughout the dream to keep the dream going ＞＞ >20.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Baixing Village, located in the Baixing Valley in the north, surrounded by snow-covered glaciers and frozen ground. Wind and snow are the colors of this land. **>6.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The old priest said that before God's grace reached this place, The endless winter had made the land here as hard as iron **>15.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Our ancestors had no choice but to venture out of the valley and survive by hunting, Their thin animal hides could not keep out the bitter wind and they often suffered from hunger and cold, Hardship was etched into their very bones and it gave the people faith **>23.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - And so, The God of the Four Seasons blessed this land **>32.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The frozen ground was cultivated into fertile farmland, The four seasons began to turn here and the miraculous Baixing Flowers, Which never wither, Came into bloom **>48.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The snow and ice turned into the spring breeze and the solid ice melted into streams **>39.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Thank you, God, I spent my childhood surrounded by warmth and happiness **>65.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Thanks to the Baixing Flowers, A specialty of Baixing Village, The village was able to trade with large towns beyond its borders and Baixing Village gradually became well known **>55.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Until one day... **>72.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Smoke rose gently from chimneys, The fragrance of flowers filled the air and the villagers guarded their peaceful home, Living year after year without worry **>60.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_10",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The summer heat ripened the crops and began to thaw the permafrost farther north, When the first expedition returned, No one knew that a plague virus known as Abyssal Spores had emerged from the rift valley and broken through to the surface **>77.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_hurt_chufa",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnStartTouch>command>Command>say ＜＜ You failed to collect all the memory points in time ＞＞>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

