                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The crops and livestock began to die and a foul stench rose from the corpses, Then came the people... everyone who returned had been infected with the plague **>3.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - What should I do... The plague is spreading, There are vengeful spirits and cries everywhere and the dead have come back to life... but they have all become monsters **>10.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Everything happened far too quickly, I prayed to the God of the Four Seasons at the altar, Begging her to save the villagers to save everyone **>14.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The god did not answer me... Just like before, The statue showed no response... The old priest said that if you remain faithful and keep kindness in your heart, you will receive the god's protection, I believed it with all my heart... But when I needed the god the most, Where was she? **>22.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I can't wait any longer, If this continues everyone will die, I have to try to soothe their souls with my own power, Somehow i think i heard the Abyssal Spores calling out to me... **>31.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - It seems... I can influence the Abyssal Spores... just as I can influence souls, If that's the case if i could keep all the spores under control... could everyone be saved? **>40.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Just as I was filled with joy and preparing to tell everyone the news... the God of the Four Seasons noticed something strange about Baixing Village **>50.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - After trying to extract the virus from several infected small animals, I felt that i might be able to control the influence of the Abyssal Spores... **>45.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The god finally answered us... but in another way.... **>55.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Extreme heat, Drought and a blazing sun that never ceased to burn hung over Baixing Village **>63.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The ground cracked, The rivers dried up and flames spread throughout the village... Why... why is this happening? **>68.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Yes, The Abyssal Spores were destroyed by the extreme heat, But the village was gone too... **>85.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_18",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The Abyssal Spores failed to destroy the village, Yet it was destroyed by the god I admired most **>78.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_30",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - It's gone... Everything is gone... **>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_31",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Everyone is dead... Dad... Mom... **>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Why am I the only one who survived? Could it be that the God of the Four Seasons spared me because of my devotion? **>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - That's impossible... The god doesn't care about us, All the god cares about is how to eliminate the plague **>8.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I was such a fool to have believed in the god all this time... **>12.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - After burying everyone, having lost my village, I could only wander from place to place **>16.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - At first, I could still carry everyone's souls with me... but after I felt their pain, I eventually chose to let them go... **>18.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },
                
                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Once people learned that I came from Baixing Village, They would look at me in panic, avoid me, curse me and drive me away **>28.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I began heading toward the nearest town, But... **>23.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I hid and fled from place to place like a rat, Every night, I would long for... the days I spent in Baixing Village... **>36.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_32",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - What I once took for granted has now become a treasure I can never have again **>42.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_41",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I'm so tired, I'm so hungry... I'm so lonely... Someone... please help me **>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_42",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - When I was sitting on the street, Nearly starving to death, At my most desperate moment, Someone who looked like a wizard handed me some bread **>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {

                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_42",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Old Wizard: Child, Would you like to come home with me? **>5.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_42",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - He told me that he had no children and that he had devoted his entire life to studying necromancy, But had no successor, He asked if I would be willing to become his apprentice **>10.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_42",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Could I finally be needed by someone again? **>15.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_42",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - After that, I began studying necromancy together with him **>20.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_42",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Those days reminded me of the time I spent with my father and made me feel the warmth of having a home **>25.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_42",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - My father? But it was different... Regardless, I decided to study magic diligently and repay him someday **>30.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_eyi_6",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ＜＜ Unbeknownst to all, The Abyssal Spores residing within Bathory's body evolved under the influence of malice... ＞＞>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_46",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Tulzo said that I was a natural-born genius at practicing necromancy, Perhaps it was related to my innate ability to see souls? **>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_46",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The days passed one after another, Just like in Baixing Village, Where a moment of distraction by the fields would make it seem as though evening had already arrived **>5.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Soon, at the age of 20, I became the youngest high-level mage in the area and reached the threshold of transcendence **>0.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },
                
                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Everyone's attitude toward me began to change, They welcomed me with smiles, Although behind my back they still called me a remnant of Baixing Village, Who knows? At least, Somehow i managed to keep the Abyss Spores **>3.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Time heals all wounds, At least, that's what I believed back then, The people in the village would be proud of me, Wouldn't they? **>10.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - But I was wrong, Wounds may heal over, But once they are torn open, The blood runs even deeper **>14.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - It was a pitch-black night. Only a sliver of moonlight breaking through the clouds illuminated the dim room, Turzo told me to lie flat on the bed. **>18.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - My consciousness gradually grew hazy, In a daze, I saw my soul leaving my body **>23.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I killed him... I killed the person who raised me, The person I thought was closest to me **>35.5>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - By the time I realized that Turzo intended to replace my soul, It was already too late... However, In my moment of despair, The Abyss Spores that had always been inside me suddenly erupted in fierce resistance **>28.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I thought I had escaped from the abyss, Only to enter another... an even deeper abyss **>40.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I no longer trust anyone **>50.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I no longer help anyone **>52.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I will no longer shed tears for anyone **>54.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - I understand now... Everything I believed in, Everything I loved, Could only become poison that slowly destroyed me **>48.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Only power will never betray me, Only magic can protect me **>58.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The Abyss Spores... I still need more power to completely control them **>62.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - Turzo's notes mention a power of purification. Good... **>66.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - The Goddess of the Four Seasons... Heh, I wonder if that heartless goddess would still be so cold after losing her divine power? **>70.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_48",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory's Memory - It hurts so much... What am I even living for? Hahahahahaha..... **>44.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Ah, I want to truly understand what is in her heart, To enter her sea of thoughts **>23.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** The matter of Baixing Village... The source of this entire tragedy lies with the God of Seasons... She calculated that sacrificing 1000 people could save the lives of a million, But she never accounted for Bathory, Unfortunately we also bear some responsibility, We failed to notice this tragedy at the time **>15.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Wait for my good news... **>38.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Captain, If you do that your mind could be assimilated by hers if something goes wrong **>27.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Don't worry, We've made it through so many hardships, My willpower isn't that fragile **>35.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Treating lives as numbers was a failure of the gods, Because of that the God of Seasons also lost her divinity, But the wrongs Bathory committed have already happened...... **>19.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Personally, I think... **>11.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** I see... Her past... **>4.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** This... Captain... What should we do now? **>6.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_63",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Someone has to pay the price for their mistakes, Since there is still a pure place in her heart, I want to show her through my actions that there is still hope in this world **>31.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_68",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** ...Beginning thought synchronization, sharing the chain of memories... **>6.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_track_start_68",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnPass>command>Command>say ** Bathory **>8.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** I already know your past **>1.5>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** I won't give you some grand speech about how everything is already in the past when it comes to your suffering **>4.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** I only want you to see another side of this world and to see the past I carry with me **>8.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: What past? I have nothing to say to someone like you, Who sits high above and lectures others about how things should be... **>13.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** There were no gods in this world to begin with, Calamities and disasters happen at every moment, Just like... what happened to your White Star Village **>19.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** People gathered of their own accord and built villages, The strong stepped forward and became warriors who fought against calamity **>24.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** But the price of becoming strong is facing calamity head-on, What you saw was the countless trials we endured **>28.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Trials bring death, But they also drive civilization to survive and grow, Life and death repeat themselves and from them order takes root, What we call gods were born from the lingering hope of all living beings, They were human too **>32.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Throughout the long ages, There have been lies, Betrayal and death **>38.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Yet humanity endured and could only keep moving forward, Faced with catastrophe, People did not choose to destroy themselves and that is why everything that exists today has survived... **>50.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Countless people abandoned their companions just to survive, Throwing away their faith for power that was within easy reach **>44.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: And what does any of that have to do with me? **>55.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: You talk about the continuation of civilization and the survival of the world as if they mean everything, But who was there to save White Star Village? Who was there to save all those innocent people in the village? **>58.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** It was a mistake made by a god, I will not make excuses for it, The authority to make divine choices was entrusted by all living beings, Yet the cost of failure fell upon the innocent, That pain itself can never be justified **>64.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: So they deserved to be sacrificed? If I were that god, This tragedy would never happen again! **>69.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** There is nothing wrong with wishing to never experience such pain again, But Bathory you believe that divine power surpassing everything is the only answer **>74.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Even if you ascend to become a god, Sooner or later you will have to make a choice. When that time comes, You will eventually become the very thing you hate **>79.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: I will never make the same choice they did! **>83.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Trauma blinds you. Hatred is quietly changing you, You deceive plunder and stop at nothing, You keep consuming others, Repeating the very pain that was inflicted upon you back then, When that day comes, will you really still be yourself? **>86.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: But... other than power, I have.... nothing left... **>92.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Losing something does not mean it is the end, You saw my memories too, Throughout the long ages, I have also witnessed countless farewells, Power was never meant to be a tool for revenge, It could have been used to protect, Do not let a tragedy from a hundred years ago imprison the person you are now forever **>96.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_sound",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Do you remember who you used to be? The kind and compassionate Bathory, She did not die, She was merely buried beneath the suffering of the snowy plains, You have simply refused to face her all this time **>101.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_bull",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** There is so much suffering in this world and countless people, Just like the villagers of Baixing Village back then, Who have no means of resisting disaster **>14.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_bull",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Join us... **>30.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_bull",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** There are countless Bathory waiting for you to save them **>24.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_bull",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: I... **>6.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_final",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: Really... how devious... That's why I've always hated lucky people like you... **>3.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_final",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: You're right, Though I still can't help feeling bitter about it, I can't keep making the same mistakes anymore **>13.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_final",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: I'll stay here and spend the rest of my life watching over those calamities.... **>24.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_final",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory: I don't regret what I did in the past, But my hands are already stained with blood, I won't join you... but I won't leave either **>19.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "s3_relay_final",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnTrigger>command>Command>say ** Bathory:...... **>7.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

                {
                    "outputname": "OnCase03",
                    "targetname": "boss_final_move",
                    "inputname": "AddOutPut",
                    "overrideparam": "OnFullyOpen>command>Command>say ** Thank you for playing **>10.0>1",
                    "delay": 0.0,
                    "timestofire": -1
                },

