                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 我只是想让你看看这个世界的另一面，也让你看见，我所背负的过往 **",
                        "delay": 8.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 巴托莉：什么过去？我和你这种身居高处空谈道理的人没有话说... **",
                        "delay": 13.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 这个世界本无神，厄难与灾祸无时无刻不在发生，就像...你们白星村一样 **",
                        "delay": 19.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 人们自发聚集，建起村落；强者挺身而出，成为抵御灾厄的勇士 **",
                        "delay": 24.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 可强大的代价，便是直面灾厄，你看到的，是我们无数次的磨难 **",
                        "delay": 28.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 磨难带来死亡，却也推着文明延续成长。生死往复，秩序由此生根；所谓神明，诞生于众生残存的希望里，他们也是人 **",
                        "delay": 32.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 漫长岁月之中，充斥谎言、背叛与死亡 **",
                        "delay": 38.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 可人类依旧撑了下来，也只能不断走下去。浩劫面前，人们没有选择自我毁灭，才有如今存续的一切... **",
                        "delay": 50.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 无数人为苟活背弃同伴，为唾手可得的力量丢掉信仰 **",
                        "delay": 44.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 巴托莉：这和我又有什么关系？ **",
                        "delay": 55.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 巴托莉：你们张口便是文明延续、世界存续，可谁来拯救白星村？谁来拯救村里那些无辜的人？ **",
                        "delay": 58.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 这是神的错误，我不会寻找借口。神抉择的权柄由众生赋予，然而失败的代价落在无辜者身上，这份伤痛本身，永远没有办法被合理化。 **",
                        "delay": 64.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 巴托莉：所以他们就活该牺牲？如果我来当那个神，悲剧就不会重演！ **",
                        "delay": 69.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 渴求不再经历痛苦没有错。但是巴托莉，你误以为，凌驾一切的神力，是唯一的答案 **",
                        "delay": 74.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 倘若你登顶成神，你迟早也要做出抉择。到那时，你终将变成你憎恨的存在 **",
                        "delay": 79.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 巴托莉：我绝不会做出和他们一样的选择！ **",
                        "delay": 83.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 创伤会蒙蔽双眼。仇恨正在悄悄改变你。你欺骗、掠夺、不择手段，你正在不断消耗别人，重复当年施加在你身上的伤害,到了那一天，你真的还是你吗？ **",
                        "delay": 86.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 巴托莉：可是...除了力量，我已经....一无所有了... **",
                        "delay": 92.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 失去不代表结局，你也看到了我的记忆，漫长岁月里我同样目睹无数别离。力量从来不是复仇的工具，它本可以用来守护。不必让百年前的悲剧，永久囚禁现在的你 **",
                        "delay": 96.0,
                        "timestofire": 1
                    },

                    {
                        "outputname": "OnTrigger",
                        "targetname": "[PR#]command",
                        "inputname": "Command",
                        "overrideparam": "say ** 还记得以前吗？那个善良，有同情心的巴托莉，她没有死去，只是被雪原的苦难掩埋了，你只是一直不愿意面对 **",
